  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT ACCURATE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096 (analyzer 9.2.0): reproduced through `hypergumbo run` on a two-file fixture. `@extends('layouts.app', [...])` gives no extends edge, `@yield('title', 'Default')` and `@component('alert', [...])` give no node; the one-argument control gives all three. `@yield('after')` between the inner and outer `@endcomponent` carries the stable_id of scope `[]` in the two-argument file and of scope `['outer']` in the control (checked against `scoped_stable_id`). Citations blade.py:66 and :108-113 are exact; blade.py last changed 2026-10-13. Fixtures: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/work/WI-pihor. Corpus impact still not measured. Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-pihor.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # 3617
